Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?=E2=9C=A8=20feat:=20require=20only=20month=20an?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d=20year=20for=20issue=20published=20date?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace the full date input in the admin issue form with month and year
fields. The value is normalized to the first day of the month (UTC) so the
existing published_at column keeps working. Format month and year displays
in UTC so they do not shift across timezones.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01R2RkcScscT3jUdGFYkUneD
